      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEXAS BANDIT (1) had been going along well winning a OPEN three back then placing at Angle Park before missing the frame latest when seventh (31.49) at Angle Park. Will find this more suitable and can atone. ECHOES OF DAD (5) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 30.82 beating Destroying. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. LAMIA NONNA MIM (8) is having her first look at this course. In the placings last time (30.43) at Angle Park after jumping from this draw. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Bold showing expected. MESSINA MISS (4) missed the placings when well supported last time – can bounce back.",
